title: Lucio Martínez Gil
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, reformist
card-image: img/es/parties/pablo_iglesias_casa_pueblo.jpg
view-if: baade_advisor = 1
new-page: true

= Lucio Martínez Gil

Martínez Gil is the secretary-general of the <span style="color: #700000;">**FNTT**</span>, the socialist landworkers' federation, and the party's foremost voice on the agrarian question. [? if land_reform > 0: He carries considerable weight across the factions now that the <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> has pushed real land reform through. ?]

- @agriculture
- @rural_campaign
- @depression
- @root: Return to main

@agriculture
title: Agricultural Policy
subtitle: Martínez Gil presses the government to accelerate land reform.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and psoe_in_government
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psoe_in_government : The <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> is not in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; agricultural_policy_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: agricultural_policy


@rural_campaign
title: Rural Campaign
subtitle: Try to campaign among the braceros and the rural poor.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and rural_policy > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if rural_policy == 0 : We have not enacted any rural policies. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; landless_psoe += 5*(1-dissent); peoples_party_support += 1

We have increased our campaigning among the landless day-labourers and the rural poor through the FNTT's networks.

@depression
title: Addressing the economic crisis
subtitle: Formulate a plan to rescue us from the economic crisis.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and wtb_adopted = 0 and black_thursday_seen
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if black_thursday_seen == 0 : We are not currently in an economic crisis. ?][? if wtb_adopted > 0 : We have already adopted the public-works plan. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; wtb_support += 2; center_dissent += 10; labor_strength += 5; wtb_points += 15

[? if not wtb_concept: The UGT's economists have been drafting a public-works plan to pull the country out of the depression, and Martínez Gil argues that rural public works - irrigation, roads, reforestation - must be central to it. He canvasses in favor of the plan throughout the party. ?][? if wtb_concept: The public-works plan has been taken up as the unions' answer to the depression, and Martínez Gil presses for rural works to be central to it. He canvasses in favor of it throughout the party. ?]
